OL,3,CWho was the Godmother of Rock 'n' Roll
OL,4,CSister Rosetta Tharpe?
OL,6,FA woman known as the "Godmother of
OL,7,FRock 'n' Roll" has been honoured with
OL,8,Fa blue plaque commemorating her
OL,9,Fcontribution to Manchester's musical
OL,10,Fhistory.
OL,12,FBut who was pioneering African
OL,13,FAmerican singer and guitarist, Sister
OL,14,FRosetta Tharpe - and what did she do
OL,15,Fto earn her nickname?
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
