OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787080721
OL,3,CWho was the Godmother of Rock 'n' Roll
OL,4,CSister Rosetta Tharpe?
OL,6,FA key moment in her career, and in
OL,7,FManchester's own musical history, came
OL,8,Fin 1964 when Sister Rosetta performed
OL,9,Fin the city as part of the legendary
OL,10,FBlues and Gospel Train event, produced
OL,11,Fand filmed by Granada TV.
OL,13,FThe show's producer, Johnnie Hamp, was
OL,14,Finstrumental in bringing her to a UK
OL,15,Faudience and later supported efforts
OL,16,Fto honour her legacy in Manchester.
OL,18,FSister Rosetta's performance on the
OL,19,FBlues and Gospel Train is still
OL,20,Fremembered as one of the most iconic
OL,21,Fin the city's musical history.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
