CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787080721
OL,3,CWho was the Godmother of Rock 'n' Roll
OL,4,CSister Rosetta Tharpe?
OL,6,FYet, despite her impact, there is
OL,7,Fstill no permanent plaque or statue
OL,8,Fcommemorating her time.
OL,10,FWatch the entire Blues and Gospel
OL,11,FTrain performance as it aired in
OL,12,FAugust 1964:
OL,14,FIn 2018, Sister Rosetta was
OL,15,Fposthumously inducted into the Rock
OL,16,Fand Roll Hall of Fame, which many
OL,17,Fclaim was an overdue recognition of
OL,18,Fher place as a true pioneer.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
