OL,3,CWho was the Godmother of Rock 'n' Roll
OL,4,CSister Rosetta Tharpe?
OL,6,FSocial historian Karen Gabay is now
OL,7,Fworking alongside Manchester
OL,8,Fcampaigners to ensure her story is
OL,9,Fpermanently woven into the city's
OL,10,Fcultural fabric.
OL,12,F"My main goal is to ensure that people
OL,13,Frecognise the significant
OL,14,Fcontributions these women made to
OL,15,FManchester's music scene and to
OL,16,FBritish music as a whole," Karen said.
OL,26,@tD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
