PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787080721
OL,3,CWho was the Godmother of Rock 'n' Roll
OL,4,CSister Rosetta Tharpe?
OL,6,F"Too often, their contributions are
OL,7,Foverlooked, or people assume their
OL,8,Finfluence has already been
OL,9,Facknowledged when, in reality, they
OL,10,Fhaven't received the recognition they
OL,11,Fdeserve."
OL,13,FThe Blue Plaque project aims to change
OL,14,Fthat, creating visible, lasting
OL,15,Ftributes that future generations can
OL,16,Fconnect with.
OL,18,F"Manchester is often seen as the music
OL,19,Fcity of the UK, yet there's so little
OL,20,Ftangible recognition for its cultural
OL,21,Fcontributions," Karen added.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@IO]zD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
