OL,3,CWho was the Godmother of Rock 'n' Roll
OL,4,CSister Rosetta Tharpe?
OL,6,F"Even though we have resources like
OL,7,Fthe Manchester Digital Archive, it's
OL,8,Fstill important to create physical
OL,9,Flocations where people can connect
OL,10,Fwith the history, learn about the
OL,11,Fartist, and discover more about their
OL,12,Fwork."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@FO]
